 To apply the vision changes, rebuild inside the container:
  cd /ros2_ws && colcon build --packages-select vision && ros2 launch
  vision vision_debug.launch.py

  The main.py fix takes effect immediately on the next ros2 run robot
  robot — no rebuild needed for that package since it's pure Python.

  Tuning note: The 25% threshold in classify_person_color is a starting
   point. If you're getting false positives (green plants/walls
  triggering it) raise it toward 0.35. If it's missing clearly green
  people, lower it toward 0.15.

