  ./ros2_ws/docker/enter_ros2.sh
  Once inside:
  ros2 run robot robot
  This loads main.py. It will print IDLE -- press BTN_1 to start zombie
   sweep.

  ---
  Terminal 3 — watch detections (optional but useful for debugging)
  ./ros2_ws/docker/enter_ros2.sh
  Once inside:
  ros2 topic echo /vision/detections
  When a green person is in frame you should see a detection with
  attribute_names: ['face_lighting', 'color'] and attribute_values: 
  ['...', 'green'].

